                                                                                                     "heading":  "Product Specifications",
                                                                                                     "content":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompact and Stylish Design:\u003c/strong\u003e Small round ottoman stool with a diameter and height of 28 cm - perfectly sized for use as a footrest, extra seating, or decorative accent in any room.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDurable Wooden Legs:\u003c/strong\u003e Four sturdy solid wood legs provide stable support and elevate the stool with a natural wood finish for a warm, modern look.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSoft Upholstered Cushion:\u003c/strong\u003e Comfortable padded top covered with high-quality, breathable fabric that is smooth to touch and visually appealing in light blue soft tones.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLightweight and Portable:\u003c/strong\u003e Easy to move around the home or office, making it convenient for versatile placement wherever extra seating or comfort is needed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMultipurpose Use:\u003c/strong\u003e Ideal as a footrest, vanity stool, kids\u0027 seat, side table, or accent piece. Its clean design complements various interior décor styles.\u003c/p\u003e"
                                                                                                 }
