                                                                                                "content":  "\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterials:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003eUpholstered in high-quality breathable fabric, with padded cushioning for comfort and solid natural wood legs for support.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCare Instructions:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eWipe clean with a soft, damp cloth to remove surface dust or stains.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAvoid harsh chemicals or abrasive cleaners that may damage the fabric or wood finish.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSpot clean fabric with mild detergent if needed, allowing it to air dry naturally.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAvoid exposing the stool to direct sunlight or excessive moisture to prevent fading or wood warping.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e",
